GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  In late summer, Tlazolteotl (#88) flew over to Waterford.
  A fleet sent by the empire of Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) 
invaded Waterford, hoping to subjugate that province ruled by Prometeo (#5) 
and made up of extensive Seas.  Tlazolteotl (#88)'s forces experienced 
little opposition in Waterford and Tlazolteotl there established our reign.
  In fall, Tlazolteotl flew into Bam Yanga.

Kingdom of Uga-Buga Makumb (#1):
  In early winter, Guerin (#18) moved into Kajaani (#1603) with his army.

  In early winter, Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1)'s minions 
initiated a campaign of conquest in Ahdogast, a Jungle province owing 
allegiance to the provincial Merman chieftain.  Kari (#81) commanded the 
invading armies.  The defending forces were led by the provincial Merman 
chieftain.  The attacking Kingdom was defeated and turned back in its 
attempt to conquer Ahdogast.


Kingdom of Prometeo (#5):
  In late summer, a fleet sent by the empire of 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) invaded Waterford, hoping to subjugate 
that province ruled by Prometeo (#5) and made up of extensive Seas.  
Tlazolteotl (#88)'s forces experienced little opposition in Waterford and 
Tlazolteotl there established our reign.


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  You have attained skill level 6 in White Magic.  Your 
characters of this exalted level gain the following Advanced Ability: 
  WHITE MAGIC- PLACES OF POWER:  The White Magician can now use the magic of 
certain Holy Places of Power to increase the success chance of spells.  At 
any Monastery, Altar or Great Hall, the success chance to cast a White Magic 
spell is increased by 20%.  For Search actions, the 20% bonus is applied 
when that type of feature is searched.  For Action spells, the bonus is 
applied if that feature type is in the same province as the character, and 
is not occupied by a monster.


END MOVES REPORT

  Congratulations!  Your kingdom has reached skill level 7 in White Magic.  
Your characters of this exalted level are awarded the following Advanced 
Ability: 
  WHITE MAGIC- "WORDS OF HEALING" SPELL (abbreviated "WH"):  A new Combat 
Spell is gained called "Words of Healing".  With this spell, a White 
Magician is able to heal himself even in the heat of battle (before now, 
healing required time-consuming magic rituals unusable in combat 
situations).  The character is completely healed when the Words of Healing 
are spoken, gaining back all lost hit points.  The spell is also half as 
likely to be disrupted by your opponent's tactics as other spells.  Note: 
with old Saga programs, order this spell with "GI 26".


END MOVES REPORT

